# Hand-written rules. Cloudflare Workers Static Assets reads this file; it is never served.
#
# @astrojs/cloudflare APPENDS the editor-managed redirects (Studio -> Pages -> Redirects,
# read at build time in astro.config.mjs) BELOW these lines in dist/client/_redirects, so
# a rule here is listed first. Keep this file to rules the Studio cannot express.
#
# Studio deep links (2026-09-29). The Studio is one prerendered page at /studio/ that
# routes on the URL hash (/studio/#/structure/pages). A PATH-style link such as
# /studio/structure/pages, /studio/media or /studio/intent/edit/... has no file behind it
# and used to answer the site's 404 page, in production too. This 200 proxies every
# /studio/* path to the Studio shell (the address bar keeps the typed path, and the
# /studio/* Content-Security-Policy in _headers still applies). The shell then moves the
# path into the hash before the Studio starts: src/sanity/lib/studio-deep-link.ts.
# The unit test in that folder pins this exact line.
/studio/* /studio/ 200
